---
id: "bgp-confederation"
title: "BGP confederation"
summary: "Member ASes 65001–65003 sit inside confederation 65000. External peers see one AS, and the AS path of the far loopback is 65000 plus the origin AS."
eyebrow: "EXERGY-LAB.NET LAB 15"
headline: "BGP confederation"

message: |
  BGP confederation 65000 with member ASes 65001, 65002, and 65003.
  x1 and x2 are outside the confederation. External AS paths hide the
  member ASes and show 65000.

name: bgp-confederation
module: [ bgp ]

addressing:
  loopback:
    ipv6: 2001:db8:1::/48
  lan:
    ipv6: 2001:db8:2::/48
  p2p:
    ipv6: 2001:db8:3::/48

groups:
  probes:
    device: frr
    members: [ x1, x2, r2, r3 ]

bgp.confederation:
  65000:
    members: [ 65001, 65002, 65003 ]

nodes:
  dut:
    role: router
    bgp.as: 65001
  r2:
    bgp.as: 65002
  r3:
    bgp.as: 65003
  x1:
    bgp.as: 65100
  x2:
    bgp.as: 65101

links: [ dut-x1, dut-r2, r2-r3, r3-x2 ]

validate:
  ipv4_ebgp:
    description: IPv4 EBGP sessions with DUT should be established
    nodes: [ x1, r2 ]
    plugin: bgp_neighbor(node.bgp.neighbors,'dut')
  ipv6_ebgp:
    description: IPv6 EBGP sessions with DUT should be established
    nodes: [ x1, r2 ]
    plugin: bgp_neighbor(node.bgp.neighbors,'dut',af='ipv6')
  x1_lb_v4:
    description: Check for IPv4 X1 loopback on X2
    nodes: [ x2 ]
    plugin: bgp_prefix(nodes.x1.loopback.ipv4,af='ipv4')
  x1_lb_v6:
    description: Check for IPv6 X1 loopback on X2
    nodes: [ x2 ]
    plugin: bgp_prefix(nodes.x1.loopback.ipv6,af='ipv6')
  x2_lb_v4:
    description: Check for IPv4 X2 loopback on X1
    nodes: [ x1 ]
    plugin: bgp_prefix(nodes.x2.loopback.ipv4,af='ipv4')
  x2_lb_v6:
    description: Check for IPv6 X2 loopback on X1
    nodes: [ x1 ]
    plugin: bgp_prefix(nodes.x2.loopback.ipv6,af='ipv6')
  x2_path_v4:
    description: Check AS path of IPv4 X2 loopback on X1
    nodes: [ x1 ]
    plugin: bgp_prefix(nodes.x2.loopback.ipv4,af='ipv4',aspath='65000 65101')
  x2_path_v6:
    description: Check AS path of IPv6 X2 loopback on X1
    nodes: [ x1 ]
    plugin: bgp_prefix(nodes.x2.loopback.ipv6,af='ipv6',aspath='65000 65101')
---
